1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,788
Once upon a time, beside an ancient temple

2
00:00:02,838 --> 00:00:04,815
in Cambodia, there was a magic

3
00:00:04,865 --> 00:00:06,572
stream full of tiny stars.

4
00:00:06,622 --> 00:00:07,855
On full-moon nights

5
00:00:07,905 --> 00:00:09,950
it lit the way to the festival.

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,118
But this morning

7
00:00:11,168 --> 00:00:13,892
the stars in the stream began to fade.

8
00:00:13,942 --> 00:00:15,643
Soon the water was dark.

9
00:00:15,693 --> 00:00:16,884
Without its light

10
00:00:16,934 --> 00:00:19,950
no one could find the way to the festival.

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,749
In the middle of the pond

12
00:00:21,799 --> 00:00:23,259
a golden lotus opened

13
00:00:23,309 --> 00:00:25,777
and out came a little golden tiger.

14
00:00:25,827 --> 00:00:27,288
Today was a Tiger day

15
00:00:27,338 --> 00:00:29,950
and the tiger felt something special.

16
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,709
A firefly named Phleu flew down.

17
00:00:32,759 --> 00:00:34,778
"Little Tiger," she said

18
00:00:34,828 --> 00:00:37,795
"only you can bring the stars back.

19
00:00:37,845 --> 00:00:39,950
Today is your lucky day!"

20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,541
King of the mountains

21
00:00:41,591 --> 00:00:43,662
the Tiger symbolizes courage

22
00:00:43,712 --> 00:00:45,708
protection, and bold power.

23
00:00:45,758 --> 00:00:46,692
Phleu smiled.

24
00:00:46,742 --> 00:00:48,208
That was exactly why

25
00:00:48,258 --> 00:00:49,950
the moon had chosen it.

26
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,744
To make the river of stars shine again

27
00:00:52,794 --> 00:00:54,803
the little hero needed three

28
00:00:54,853 --> 00:00:57,156
lucky treasures: its lucky color

29
00:00:57,206 --> 00:00:59,950
its lucky path, and its lucky numbers.

30
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,973
"Let's go!" said the tiger

31
00:01:03,023 --> 00:01:06,578
and it set off on its adventure

32
00:01:06,628 --> 00:01:09,950
with Phleu right by its side.

33
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,975
People born in the Year of the Tiger

34
00:01:13,025 --> 00:01:16,168
are brave, confident, and competitive.

35
00:01:16,218 --> 00:01:18,353
Tigers are natural leaders

36
00:01:18,403 --> 00:01:19,950
who act decisively.

37
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,189
The first treasure was waiting

38
00:01:22,239 --> 00:01:24,801
in a garden of a thousand lanterns.

39
00:01:24,851 --> 00:01:26,666
Only one shone brightest.

40
00:01:26,716 --> 00:01:28,607
It was orange, the tiger's

41
00:01:28,657 --> 00:01:29,950
lucky color today.

42
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,933
The tiger tied a orange

43
00:01:31,983 --> 00:01:33,916
ribbon around its neck.

44
00:01:33,966 --> 00:01:36,933
"Wear your lucky color," said Phleu

45
00:01:36,983 --> 00:01:39,950
"and good luck stays close to you."

46
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,430
Next, they came to a crossroads

47
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,710
with many paths.

48
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,550
One path began to glow.

49
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:47,710
It pointed to the northwest

50
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:49,950
the tiger's lucky direction.

51
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,246
But the path led into

52
00:01:51,296 --> 00:01:52,543
a dark, quiet forest.

53
00:01:52,593 --> 00:01:53,654
The tiger stopped.

54
00:01:53,704 --> 00:01:55,012
Sometimes, people born

55
00:01:55,062 --> 00:01:57,543
in the Year of the Tiger can be impulsive

56
00:01:57,593 --> 00:01:59,950
or impatient with slower-moving people.

57
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,592
Phleu came close and smiled.

58
00:02:02,642 --> 00:02:05,139
"Breathe slowly," she said.

59
00:02:05,189 --> 00:02:06,837
"Trust your heart.

60
00:02:06,887 --> 00:02:09,950
You are stronger than you think."

61
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,820
Step by step, the tiger

62
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:13,690
walked into the forest.

63
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:17,104
Its golden glow lit up the trees, and soon

64
00:02:17,154 --> 00:02:19,950
the whole forest was full of light.

65
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,311
The little hero learned that its worries

66
00:02:23,361 --> 00:02:26,589
were small, and its good heart was big.

67
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:29,950
Balance and courage always help us grow.

68
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,347
At last, they reached a great

69
00:02:32,397 --> 00:02:34,413
stone door in the temple.

70
00:02:34,463 --> 00:02:36,562
Carved above it were bells

71
00:02:36,612 --> 00:02:39,950
stairs, and a riddle about lucky numbers.

72
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,525
"The door opens only

73
00:02:41,575 --> 00:02:43,966
at your best time," said Phleu.

74
00:02:44,016 --> 00:02:45,462
For the Tiger today

75
00:02:45,512 --> 00:02:48,218
that is from 7 to 9 in the evening.

76
00:02:48,268 --> 00:02:49,950
They waited patiently.

77
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,502
When the time came

78
00:02:51,552 --> 00:02:54,864
the tiger rang the golden bells 4 times

79
00:02:54,914 --> 00:02:56,847
its first lucky number.

80
00:02:56,897 --> 00:02:57,881
Ding!

81
00:02:57,931 --> 00:02:59,950
The door began to shine.

82
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,086
The door opened

83
00:03:01,136 --> 00:03:03,586
and a stairway of light appeared.

84
00:03:03,636 --> 00:03:06,162
The tiger climbed 34 glowing steps

85
00:03:06,212 --> 00:03:07,905
its second lucky number

86
00:03:07,955 --> 00:03:09,950
up to the top of the tower.

87
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,103
At the top of the tower, they found

88
00:03:13,153 --> 00:03:16,436
a golden star stone, bright and warm.

89
00:03:16,486 --> 00:03:19,950
It was the heart of the river of stars!

90
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,929
Around the star stone, seven little lights

91
00:03:22,979 --> 00:03:25,695
twinkled, one for each day of the week.

92
00:03:25,745 --> 00:03:28,319
Tuesday and Wednesday shone brightest

93
00:03:28,369 --> 00:03:29,950
the Tiger's lucky days.

94
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,894
Time was running out.

95
00:03:31,944 --> 00:03:34,857
Holding the star stone carefully

96
00:03:34,907 --> 00:03:37,450
the little hero hurried home

97
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:39,950
with Phleu right beside it.

98
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,774
Back at the pond, everyone was waiting.

99
00:03:43,824 --> 00:03:45,538
The night was dark

100
00:03:45,588 --> 00:03:48,381
and the full moon was rising.

101
00:03:48,431 --> 00:03:49,950
Was it too late?

102
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,966
The tiger dropped the star

103
00:03:52,016 --> 00:03:53,671
stone into the stream.

104
00:03:53,721 --> 00:03:56,074
For a moment, nothing happened.

105
00:03:56,124 --> 00:03:57,159
Then, sparkle!

106
00:03:57,209 --> 00:03:59,950
Thousands of stars lit up the water!

107
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,281
The river of stars shone again.

108
00:04:02,331 --> 00:04:04,236
Lanterns rose into the sky

109
00:04:04,286 --> 00:04:06,717
and the full-moon festival began.

110
00:04:06,767 --> 00:04:07,920
Everyone cheered

111
00:04:07,970 --> 00:04:09,950
for the little golden hero!

112
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,669
The full moon shone down warmly

113
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:14,687
as if to say thank you.

114
00:04:14,737 --> 00:04:17,669
The tiger felt peaceful and proud.

115
00:04:17,719 --> 00:04:19,950
It had done its very best.

116
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,311
If you were born in the Year of the Tiger

117
00:04:23,361 --> 00:04:25,114
today is your day too.

118
00:04:25,164 --> 00:04:27,737
Like our hero, be brave, be kind

119
00:04:27,787 --> 00:04:29,950
and follow your good heart.

120
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,908
Let's remember today's luck.

121
00:04:31,958 --> 00:04:33,307
Lucky color: orange.

122
00:04:33,357 --> 00:04:35,964
Best time: from 7 to 9 in the evening.

123
00:04:36,014 --> 00:04:37,852
Lucky direction: northwest.

124
00:04:37,902 --> 00:04:39,950
Lucky numbers: 4, 34, and 330.

125
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,188
And so, under the bright full moon

126
00:04:43,238 --> 00:04:46,712
the little golden hero and Phleu fell

127
00:04:46,762 --> 00:04:49,950
fast asleep, dreaming of tomorrow.

128
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,617
That's your Chinese zodiac

129
00:04:51,667 --> 00:04:52,771
fortune for today.

130
